**Purpose of each dependency**

| Dependency | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| spring-boot-starter-data-jpa | Enables JPA and Hibernate support |
| spring-boot-starter-web | Builds REST/Web applications |
| spring-boot-devtools | Automatic restart during development |
| mysql-connector-j | Connects Spring Boot with MySQL |
